",
  "dataset": "Usage: dohc dataset <verb> [arguments] [options]

Create, change, and use transactional Collections.

Verbs:
  list                     List Collections.
  describe                 Show a Collection's tables, fields, and operations.
  history                  List saved operations, with values to undo edits.
  historyRevision          Show the saved source of one past revision.
  prepareHistoryRestore    Prepare a change that reverses one saved change.
  permissions              List app bindings and explicit data grants.
  setGrant                 Add or change an explicit data grant.
  removeGrant              Remove an explicit data grant.
  lifecycle                Show a Collection's archive state and its apps.
  archive                  Stop a Collection's operations and keep its records.
  restore                  Restore an archived Collection under its rules.
  deletePreview            Review what deleting a Collection affects.
  delete                   Permanently delete a Collection and all its data.
  pendingAttempts          List pending responses that still hold a retry.
  reconcileAttempt         Clear the retry of a saved pending response.
  cancelAttempt            Cancel an unconfirmed pending response.
  export                   Save a private recovery archive of a Collection.
  prepareRecovery          Check a recovery archive before restoring it.
  claimRecovery            Restore a Collection from a prepared archive.
  discardRecovery          Cancel a prepared recovery before it installs.
  upload                   Upload a file for a file field.
  file                     Read an uploaded file.
  createForm               Create a form app that adds records to a Collection.
  prepareRelationChoices   Prepare public choices for a relation field.
  create                   Write source for a new Collection, ready to approve.
  prepare                  Capture existing Collection source for review.
  approve                  Approve prepared source.
  discard                  Discard prepared source. The files stay in place.
  prepareMigration         Prepare new source and migration SQL for review.
  migrationPreviewPage     Read more records a prepared migration changes.
  prepareSchemaChange      Prepare one field, table, or name change.
  approveMigration         Apply a reviewed migration.
  discardMigration         Discard a prepared migration.
  invoke                   Run an approved operation.

Run dohc inside a workspace folder while the dohc app is open.
Each verb takes one JSON object that names workspaceId. Find workspaceId in
.dohc/manifest.json at the workspace root.
datasetPath is the caller-relative dataset.json path. List and describe return
it alongside the internal datasetId.
After moving the file, update commands and app manifests. An old path reports a
broken reference.
These verbs use the same Collection rules as dohc. They do not accept SQL or
caller identity.

Options:
  --as-agent   Post and read chat as an agent.
  --json       Print the result as JSON.
  --help       Show help. -h does the same.

Run dohc dataset <verb> --help to see its arguments and options.
",
