Restore a Collection from a prepared archive.

Fields: workspaceId, transferId, manifestSha256, sourceCursor, oldHostStopped
Set workspaceId to recovery.sourceCursor.workspaceId from prepareRecovery.
Set transferId to recovery.transferId from prepareRecovery.
Set manifestSha256 to recovery.manifestSha256 from prepareRecovery.
Set sourceCursor to recovery.sourceCursor from prepareRecovery.
